  "descriptions": {
    "en": {
      "language": "en",
      "value": "Sdsbrowser is an r shiny webapp developed to make the available sds datasets (following the systematic and digital documentation of stone artefacts recording system) more accessible. It is designed to give you a quick overview on the spatial and temporal scope of sites previously analysed with sds and the distribution of artefacts within these sites."
    }
  },
